Privacy Policy for victorv4

Effective Date: 2026 10 09
• No Data Collection: victorv4 does not collect, store, share, or process any personal data, usage information, or device identifiers from our users.
• Cookies and Tracking: We do not use cookies, analytics tools, or third-party tracking scripts.
• Third-Party Services: We do not integrate with third-party services that collect data on our behalf.
• Changes to This Policy: If our practices change in the future, we will update this policy and post the revised version on this page.
